  "description": "<p data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"340\">Beleef de ultieme Mario-ervaring met <strong data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"171\">Super Mario All-Stars</strong> voor de <strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"198\">Super Nintendo</strong>!<br data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"202\">Deze legendarische verzameling bundelt vier klassieke Mario-games in één pakket, volledig geremasterd met verbeterde graphics en geluid.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"371\">🕹️ <strong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"369\">Inbegrepen spellen:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<li data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"397\">\r\n<p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"397\"><strong data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"395\">Super Mario Bros.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"425\"><strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"423\">Super Mario Bros. 2</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"453\">\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"453\"><strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"451\">Super Mario Bros. 3</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"519\"><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"475\">The Lost Levels</strong> (voorheen nooit uitgebracht buiten Japan)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"540\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"538\">Kenmerken:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<li data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"585\">\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"585\">Originele <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"578\">Super Nintendo (SNES)</strong> game</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"638\"><strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"607\">Losse cartridge</strong> (zonder doos of handleiding)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<p data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"695\">Volledig geremasterde versies van de NES-klassiekers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"746\">Perfecte keuze voor verzamelaars en retro-fans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"832\">🎯 <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"761\">Staat:</strong><br data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"764\">Game in <strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"797\">goede gebruikte staat</strong>, <strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"829\">getest en volledig werkend</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"921\">🕹️ <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"851\">Platform:</strong> Super Nintendo (SNES)<br data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"876\">📦 <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"892\">Levering:</strong> Alleen losse gamecartridge</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"992\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"992\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Vier klassiekers in één – pure Nintendo-nostalgie op zijn best!</strong></p>",
